**DIRAC
.TITLE
  MgF, ^2Sigma
.WAVE F 
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
15
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
15
.INTFLG
1 1 0
# T- operator - employ it only with the KU wave-function,
# this operator is carrying factor of 2 
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM'
 DSIGMADOT
 'XNUCFIEL'
 'YNUCFIEL'
 'ZNUCFIEL'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0000
.TRSMIX
#.ONESYS
.INTFLG
1 0 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF
.MAXITR
1
*END OF
